<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 68.6264 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 68.6264 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 68.6264 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 68.6385 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    Sep 6		   Sep 5</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     68.6264		 68.6385</p>
<p> volume ($ million)		  3.845		   5.465</p>
<p>				    Sep 6		   Sep 3</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 46.3600		 46.3500</p>
<p> volume (DM million)		 0.100		   0.100</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
